# Google Places API (New): place photos and Google star ratings.
# Used only by the Supabase place-photo function, on the server. Never put it in the app or Config/.
#
# To get one: Google Cloud console -> pick or create a project -> turn on billing
# -> APIs & Services -> Library -> enable "Places API (New)"
# -> Credentials -> Create credentials -> API key.
# Restrict the key to "Places API (New)" only. Leave application restrictions on None (server-side use).
# Setting a small budget alert under Billing -> Budgets & alerts is a good idea.
#
# Copy this file to supabase/functions/.env and paste your key below. That file is gitignored; never commit a real key.
# Without a key, places fall back to visit photos and the map, and no Google ratings are shown.
GOOGLE_PLACES_KEY=XXX
